// BFME 2 has no MobMemberSlavedUpdate: retail game.dat carries no
// "MobMemberSlavedUpdate" module-name string and the module factory does not
// register it, so the Zero Hour bodies this port carried (ctor, dtor,
// onObjectCreated, onEnslave, onSlaverDie, onSlaverDamage, update,
// doCatchUpLogic, start/stopSlavedEffects, xfer, loadPostProcess) were
// nonmatching reconstructions of code retail never had, and they left the unit
// unable to link. Only the Int instantiation of sqr (0x000E13CA, which
// doCatchUpLogic used to emit) is a retail body here; instantiate it directly.
template Int sqr<Int>(Int);
